{"id":"sostradanie","lemma":"сострадание","pos":"noun","rank":4955,"glosses":["compassion, sympathy"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/7d/Ru-%D1%81%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B4%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D1%81%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B4%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"сострадания","plural":"сострадания"},"examples":[{"text":"Где твоё сострадание?","en":"Where is your compassion?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/727910","words":[{"g":"where"},{"g":"your","l":"твой"},null]},{"text":"Нет ничего важнее сострадания.","en":"Nothing is more important than compassion.","words":[{"g":"no / there isn't"},{"g":"nothing"},{"g":"important","l":"важный"},null]},{"text":"Нет ничего важнее, чем сострадание.","en":"Nothing is more important than compassion.","words":[{"g":"no / there isn't"},{"g":"nothing"},{"g":"important","l":"важный"},{"g":"than"},null]},{"text":"Я надеялся на каплю сострадания.","en":"I was hoping for a little sympathy.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to hope","l":"надеяться"},{"g":"on / at"},null,null]},{"text":"Отсутствие у Тома сострадания удивило Мэри.","en":"Tom's lack of compassion surprised Mary.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/71991","words":[{"g":"lack, absence"},{"g":"at / by"},{"g":"volume","l":"том"},null,{"g":"to astonish","l":"удивить"},null]}]}